endix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2030","Clear sequence A.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Up | A + Hold, held for 1 second"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2054","Order | B + Hold, held for 1 second",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer","With Record off:"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2095","Clear sequence B.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Order | B + Hold, held for 1 second"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2119","Oct | Mod + Hold",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer","With Record off:"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2141","Erase the current modulation track.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Oct | Mod + Hold"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2183","Hold Oct | Mod and press Hold",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer","With Record off:"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2218","Erase the next modulation track. Press Hold repeatedly to clear all modulation tracks.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Hold Oct | Mod and press Hold"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2311","Shift + Key",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer","With Record off:"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2328","Transpose the sequence.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Shift + Key"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2358","Shift + A/B",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer","With Record off:"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2375","Reload pattern A or B as previously saved in memory.",["Sequencer","With Record off:","Shift + A/B"]],["Microfreak/UG/20%20Appendix%20C%20-%20Cheat%20Sheet/","source-block-2434","With Step Record mode active:",["20 Appendix C: Cheat Sheet","Sequencer"]],